  dialogueList:
    dialogues:
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "H\u1EA1, h\u1EA1 thanh ki\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3 xu\u1ED1ng r\u1ED3i b\xECnh
        t\u0129nh n\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n ch\xE0ng trai \xE0. "
      - "\u0110\xFAng r\u1ED3i, ch\xEDnh l\xE0 Thanh Ki\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3."
      - "Thanh Ki\u1EBFm m\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111ang c\u1EA7m, n\xF3 h\u1ED5ng
        t\u1EA7m th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE2u."
      - "N\xF3 \u0111\xE3 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn ng\u01B0\u01A1i, m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        anh h\xF9ng x\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE1ng, "
      - "ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF3 h\u1ED5 th\u1EB9n kh\xF4ng khi \u0111ang d\u1EA7n
        tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh k\u1EBB gi\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xF4ng g\u1EDBm tay "
      - "trong khi c\u1EA7m Thanh Ki\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3?"
    - name: Sketon
      lines:
      - "C\xF3 g\xEC l\xE0 h\u1ED5 th\u1EB9n, khi thanh tr\u1EEBng l\u0169 \xE1c
        qu\u1EF7 c\xE1c ng\u01B0\u01A1i!"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "\u0110\xFAng th\u1EADt, \u0111ao ki\u1EBFm th\xF4ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng
        ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t m\xE1u c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB x\u1EA5u hay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1ED1t."
      - "Nh\u01B0ng Thanh Ki\u1EBFm qu\xE1i qu\u1EF7 n\xE0y \u0111\xF2i h\u1ECFi
        r\u1EA5t cao. "
      - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EA7m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xF3 ph\u1EA3i Th\u1EADt m\u1EA1nh
        m\u1EBD, Th\u1EADt gan d\u1EA1, v\xE0 C\xF3 tr\xE1i tim n\u1ED3ng \u1EA5m
        bao la. "
      - "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i v\u1ED1n l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ED9i t\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EE7
        c\u1EA3 ba y\u1EBFu t\u1ED1 \u0111\xF3. "
      - "Nh\u01B0ng b\xE2y gi\u1EDD ng\u01B0\u01A1i l\u1EA1i l\xE0 M\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        m\u1EA5t \u0111i m\u1ED9t t\xECnh y\xEAu, ta n\xF3i c\xF3 ph\u1EA3i kh\xF4ng,
        Sketon\u2026"
    - name: Sketon
      lines:
      - "\u2026"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "\u1EEA. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n m\u1EA5t \u0111i 1 trong 3 t\u1ED1 ch\u1EA5t m\xE0
        thanh ki\u1EBFm y\xEAu c\u1EA7u, "
      - "\xFD ch\xED ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EA7m n\xF3 r\u1EA5t d\u1EC5 b\u1ECB lay
        l\u1EA1c,"
      - "ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EA5y t\xE2m tr\u1EA1ng n\xF3ng gi\u1EADn th\u1EA5t
        th\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng Sketon,"
      - "ta kh\xF4ng ngh\u0129 ng\u01B0\u01A1i b\u1ECB d\u1EADy th\xEC s\u1EDBm? "
      - "C\xF2n n\u1EEFa, chuy\u1EC7n n\xF3 b\u1ECB hong \u1EA5n c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng
        ph\u1EA3i t\u1EF1 nhi\xEAn."
      - "S\u1EBD th\u1EBF n\xE0o n\u1EBFu m\u1ED9t k\u1EBB thi\u1EBFu \u0111i 1 trong
        3 ph\u1EA9m ch\u1EA5t \u0111\xF3 m\xE0 c\u1EA7m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c Thanh
        Ki\u1EBFm?"
      - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c phong \u1EA5n c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng
        ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 t\u1EA7m th\u01B0\u1EDDng, cho n\xEAn\u2026"
    - name: Sketon
      lines:
      - "Cho n\xEAn.. gi\u1EDD ta gi\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i
        ch\u1EE9 g\xEC?"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "Kh\xF4ng! N\u1EBFu gi\u1EBFt ta, ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng g\u1EB7p
        \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA1n c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        n\u1EEFa! "
      - "N\u1EBFu gi\u1EBFt ta, ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ECBa ng\u1EE5c
        kh\xF4ng c\xF3 T\u1EED Th\u1EA7n, "
      - "k\u1EBB gi\u1EBFt T\u1EED Th\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i ch\u1ECBu l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n
        kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ch\u1ED1ng l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, "
      - "ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD bi\u1EBFn th\xE0nh Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt ti\u1EBFp
        theo, thay th\u1EBF v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a ta, t\u1EA1i n\u01A1i n\xE0y!"
    - name: Sketon
      lines:
      - "Th\u1EADt \u0111\xE1ng s\u1EE3. Cho n\xEAn..?"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "N\xF3i chung ta kh\xF4ng mu\u1ED1n ch\u1EBFt, Sketon!"
      - "Krixim, ng\u01B0\u01A1i mu\u1ED1n Krixim ch\u1EE9 g\xEC. \u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c
        r\u1ED3i, \u0111\u1EC3 ta ngh\u0129. "
      - "Krixim \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt, t\u1EE9c l\xE0 ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n ph\u1EA7n h\u1ED3n
        m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ph\u1EA7n th\xE2n x\xE1c. \u0110\xFAng r\u1ED3i!"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      lines:
      - "Th\xE2n x\xE1c v\u1ED1n l\xE0 v\u1EADt ch\u1EA5t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED9i
        t\u1EE5 v\xE0 k\u1EBFt tinh t\u1EEB n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE7a linh
        h\u1ED3n. "
      - "M\u1ECDi linh h\u1ED3n sau khi ch\u1EBFt tr\xEAn tr\u1EA7n gian, b\u1ECB
        h\xFAt xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\xE2y "
      - "\u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\u1ED9n l\u1EABn trong b\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9a
        linh h\u1ED3n \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EDD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA7u thai,
        Krixim c\u0169ng v\u1EADy. "
      - "C\xE1c linh h\u1ED3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE2n r\xE3 v\xE0 tr\u1ED9n l\u1EABn
        v\u1EDBi nhau \u1EA5y, kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \xFD th\u1EE9c n\u1EEFa."
      - "Tr\u1EEB khi ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 m\u1ED9t v\u1EADt d\u1EABn, \u0111\u1EC3 r\xE1p
        n\u1EAFn ch\xFAng l\u1EA1i v\u1EC1 d\u1EA1ng ban \u0111\u1EA7u. "
      - "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF2n gi\u1EEF v\u1EADt g\xEC li\xEAn quan t\u1EDBi c\u01A1
        th\u1EC3 c\u1EE7a c\xF4 b\u1EA1n Krixim n\xE0y kh\xF4ng, m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc
        l\xF4ng v\u0169 ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EA1n?"
  talkButton: {fileID: 8501491540886582705}
  dialogueDelay: 0
  itemPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  objToMoveToPlayer: {fileID: 0}
  positionSetterForPlayer: {fileID: 614518909}
